{"id":"b4f292ee2a50229e","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-zpp-rp-intersection-corp.md","title":"ZPP = RP ∩ coRP","display":"thm-zpp-rp-intersection-corp — ZPP = RP ∩ coRP","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-zpp-rp-intersection-corp","aliases":["28-thm-zpp-rp-intersection-corp","ZPP equals RP intersection coRP"],"display":"thm-zpp-rp-intersection-corp — ZPP = RP ∩ coRP","depends_on":["[[28-df-zpp]]","[[28-df-rp]]","[[28-df-co-rp]]"],"source_book_location":"Theorem 7.8; printed p.132; PDF p.158; book proof assigned as Exercise 7.6","source_printed_pages":"132","source_pdf_pages":"158","source_status":"statement-checked","proof_status":"local-proof-reviewed","local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-zpp-rp-intersection-corp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-zpp-rp-intersection-corp</span><span>ZPP equals RP intersection coRP</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-zpp-rp-intersection-corp — ZPP = RP ∩ coRP"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"96a7916ef9ebba8a\" href=\"?note=96a7916ef9ebba8a\" title=\"28-df-zpp\">28-df-zpp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"efc30a60f20cb4de\" href=\"?note=efc30a60f20cb4de\" title=\"28-df-rp\">28-df-rp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2bf2934e8ac23510\" href=\"?note=2bf2934e8ac23510\" title=\"28-df-co-rp\">28-df-co-rp</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Theorem 7.8; printed p.132; PDF p.158; book proof assigned as Exercise 7.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"132"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"158"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{ZPP}\">\\(\\mathbf{ZPP}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"96a7916ef9ebba8a\" href=\"?note=96a7916ef9ebba8a\" title=\"28-df-zpp\">28-df-zpp</a> 的零错误期望时间类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{RP}\">\\(\\mathbf{RP}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{coRP}\">\\(\\mathbf{coRP}\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"efc30a60f20cb4de\" href=\"?note=efc30a60f20cb4de\" title=\"28-df-rp\">28-df-rp</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2bf2934e8ac23510\" href=\"?note=2bf2934e8ac23510\" title=\"28-df-co-rp\">28-df-co-rp</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{ZPP}=\\mathbf{RP}\\cap\\mathbf{coRP}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{ZPP}=\\mathbf{RP}\\cap\\mathbf{coRP}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地论证：RP 和 coRP 两个判定算法独立成对重复；RP 输出 1 时确定回答是，coRP 输出 0 时确定回答否。每次至少 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1/2\">\\(1/2\\)</span> 概率得到确定答案，重复次数被期望至多 2 的几何变量控制。反向，零错误机器在期望时间 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(n)\">\\(p(n)\\)</span> 下，运行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2p(n)\">\\(2p(n)\\)</span> 步后若未停机则输出 0，得到 RP；超时输出 1 得到 coRP。Markov 不等式保证超时概率至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1/2\">\\(1/2\\)</span>。定义 ZPP 已与交集分离，因此此处不是重言式。</p>\n<p>R6本地证明复核：已复核本节所列完整概率/模拟推导；此状态针对本地论证，不把旧来源定位自动升级为逐页证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-zpp","status":"resolved","id":"96a7916ef9ebba8a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-zpp]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-rp","status":"resolved","id":"efc30a60f20cb4de","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-rp]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-co-rp","status":"resolved","id":"2bf2934e8ac23510","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-co-rp]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-zpp","status":"resolved","id":"96a7916ef9ebba8a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{ZPP}$ 为 [[28-df-zpp]] 的零错误期望时间类，$\\mathbf{RP}$、$\\mathbf{coRP}$ 分别见 [[28-df-rp]]、[[28-df-co-rp]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-rp","status":"resolved","id":"efc30a60f20cb4de","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{ZPP}$ 为 [[28-df-zpp]] 的零错误期望时间类，$\\mathbf{RP}$、$\\mathbf{coRP}$ 分别见 [[28-df-rp]]、[[28-df-co-rp]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-co-rp","status":"resolved","id":"2bf2934e8ac23510","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{ZPP}$ 为 [[28-df-zpp]] 的零错误期望时间类，$\\mathbf{RP}$、$\\mathbf{coRP}$ 分别见 [[28-df-rp]]、[[28-df-co-rp]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{ZPP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{RP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{coRP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{ZPP}=\\mathbf{RP}\\cap\\mathbf{coRP}.","display":true},{"tex":"1/2","display":false},{"tex":"p(n)","display":false},{"tex":"2p(n)","display":false},{"tex":"1/2","display":false}],"bytes":1568,"backlinks":[{"id":"96a7916ef9ebba8a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"有限期望蕴涵以概率 1 停机；即便在零测集随机带上停机，输出也须正确。定义独立于 RP 与 coRP，故 [[28-thm-zpp-rp-intersection-corp]] 是需要证明的等价定理。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-117","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"类关系：[[28-thm-zpp-rp-intersection-corp]]、[[28-thm-rp-contained-np]]、[[28-thm-adleman]]、[[28-thm-sipser-gacs-lautemann]]。"}],"outgoing":["96a7916ef9ebba8a","efc30a60f20cb4de","2bf2934e8ac23510"]}